{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22186","headline":"喜陈兄至 · 白居易","name":"喜陈兄至","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄鸟啼欲歇，青梅结半成。\n坐怜春物尽，起入东园行。\n携觞嬾独酌，忽闻叩门声。\n闲人犹喜至，何况是陈兄。\n从容尽日语，稠叠长年情。\n勿轻一醆酒，可以话平生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22186.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22186","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}